# The sentinel that runs .github/workflows/ledger-probe-unreal.yml.
#
# Touching this file and pushing runs the UE machine probe on Jafar's PC.
# It exists because a workflow_dispatch workflow must live on the default
# branch to be dispatchable, and this one lives on the working branch by
# standing instruction. Delete this file and the push trigger together when
# the workflow reaches main.
#
# One line per run, appended, so the file is also the dispatch log.
